<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Launch Radar — pre-token protocols ranked by implied value</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">
    <span class="blip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div>
      <h1>Token Launch Radar</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Pre-token protocols ranked by what their token would be worth if the record stayed as it is — and exactly how to farm each one.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="stats" id="stats" aria-label="Board statistics"></div>
</header>

<section class="model-note" id="model-note" aria-label="How implied value is derived"></section>

<main>
  <div class="controls" role="search">
    <label class="ctl grow">Search
      <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Protocol, category or chain…" autocomplete="off">
    </label>
    <label class="ctl">Category
      <select id="category"><option value="">All categories</option></select>
    </label>
    <label class="ctl">Chain
      <select id="chain"><option value="">All chains</option></select>
    </label>
    <label class="ctl">Sort by
      <select id="sort">
        <option value="implied">Implied value</option>
        <option value="tvl">TVL</option>
        <option value="growth">7-day growth</option>
        <option value="age">Time without a token</option>
        <option value="multiple">Category multiple</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <label class="ctl check">
      <input id="watchonly" type="checkbox"> Watchlist only (≥ $50M TVL, no token)
    </label>
  </div>

  <div id="view-board">
    <table class="board" id="board">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th class="num">#</th><th>Protocol</th><th>Category</th><th>Chains</th>
          <th class="num">TVL</th><th class="num">7d</th><th class="num">No token for</th>
          <th class="num">Multiple</th><th class="num">Implied value</th><th></th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="empty" id="empty" hidden>No protocol matches those filters. Loosen the search or clear a filter.</p>
  </div>

  <article id="view-detail" hidden></article>

  <section class="live" id="live" aria-label="Tokens that already trade"></section>
</main>

<footer>
  <p>Implied value is this radar's own model output, derived only from the snapshot's figures (TVL, 7-day change, listing date, chains and the market-cap/TVL ratios of tokenised peers in the same category). It is not a prediction that a token will launch, or when. Data: DefiLlama snapshot, <span id="asof"></span>. A protocol shown here records no token in that snapshot.</p>
</footer>

<script src="../data.js"></script>
<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```
